@Tournament.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5104
@accessToken = replace-with-access-token
@tournamentId = replace-with-tournament-guid

### List tournaments
GET {{Tournament.Api_HostAddress}}/tournaments?page=1&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json

### Create tournament (startsAtUtc must be in the future and end with Z)
POST {{Tournament.Api_HostAddress}}/tournaments
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Local Test Tournament",
  "description": "Temporary tournament for API testing",
  "startsAtUtc": "2030-01-01T12:00:00Z",
  "initialTimeSeconds": 180,
  "incrementSeconds": 2,
  "maxParticipants": 8
}

### Tournament details, participants, and matches
GET {{Tournament.Api_HostAddress}}/tournaments/{{tournamentId}}
Accept: application/json

### Join
POST {{Tournament.Api_HostAddress}}/tournaments/{{tournamentId}}/join
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Leave before the tournament starts
DELETE {{Tournament.Api_HostAddress}}/tournaments/{{tournamentId}}/leave
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Cancel before the tournament starts
POST {{Tournament.Api_HostAddress}}/tournaments/{{tournamentId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Start (only after StartsAtUtc)
POST {{Tournament.Api_HostAddress}}/tournaments/{{tournamentId}}/start
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Advance: pair the next round (or complete after the last round) and retry pending game creation.
### Safe to call repeatedly. Rounds also advance automatically when the last game of a round ends.
POST {{Tournament.Api_HostAddress}}/tournaments/{{tournamentId}}/pairings
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Standings (points, Buchholz, W/D/L, byes)
GET {{Tournament.Api_HostAddress}}/tournaments/{{tournamentId}}/standings
Accept: application/json

### Re-queue matches whose game creation was rejected and retry them
POST {{Tournament.Api_HostAddress}}/tournaments/{{tournamentId}}/provisioning/retry
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Owner/admin override for a stuck match (WhiteWin, BlackWin or Draw)
PUT {{Tournament.Api_HostAddress}}/tournaments/{{tournamentId}}/matches/replace-with-match-guid/result
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "result": "Draw" }

### Complete tournament (owner/admin operation)
POST {{Tournament.Api_HostAddress}}/tournaments/{{tournamentId}}/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
